{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive five nights at school</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Julio's Adventure 3, you play Zamorano, a secondary school teacher trapped overnight at Tamixa School.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: survive until dawn while completing tasks throughout the building to maintain your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670210/extras/f2375bd4d656c9b2522e475fff1b1a23.poster.avif?t=1767010618\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670210/extras/f2375bd4d656c9b2522e475fff1b1a23.webm?t=1767010618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670210/extras/f2375bd4d656c9b2522e475fff1b1a23.mp4?t=1767010618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sanity changes everything.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing tasks such as cleaning the school, organising books, or collecting materials is vital to avoid losing your sanity. The less sanity you have, the more unpredictable and dangerous Julio and his friends become, manifesting strange powers within the school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At zero sanity, the school is no longer a safe place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670210/extras/9cc9b4c12e02191268367f5dfbc1bcb0.poster.avif?t=1767010618\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670210/extras/9cc9b4c12e02191268367f5dfbc1bcb0.webm?t=1767010618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670210/extras/9cc9b4c12e02191268367f5dfbc1bcb0.mp4?t=1767010618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch, move, and make decisions</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use security cameras to monitor students... as long as there is electricity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face power outages that will force you to move and react quickly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of random events, such as recess music, that can give you a break... or put you in danger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670210/extras/dd55ad55d208bf100cc478933c486300.poster.avif?t=1767010618\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670210/extras/dd55ad55d208bf100cc478933c486300.webm?t=1767010618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670210/extras/dd55ad55d208bf100cc478933c486300.mp4?t=1767010618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670210?t=1767010618","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670210?t=1767010618","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670210/d6999a98518a9dd72df96623f30f3df7d29ae37a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767010618","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670210/d6999a98518a9dd72df96623f30f3df7d29ae37a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767010618","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descrip